{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260827/photo/bkn-20260827100558406-0827_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260827101335\"/><p>日本著名藝術家草間彌生。</p><p>日本傳媒周四（27日）報道，日本著名藝術家草間彌生因多重器官衰竭，本月14日在東京一間醫院去世，終年97歲。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T02:23:25.641884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}